OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds say farewell to closed
OL,4,Aschool at service
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 700 people gathered in an
OL,7,Fabbey to say goodbye to a 135-year-old
OL,8,Fschool that closed without warning.
OL,10,FPupils wore their uniforms to Sunday's
OL,11,Fservice at Sherborne Abbey for Leweston
OL,12,FSchool, which shut suddenly during
OL,13,FOctober half term. The company that ran
OL,14,Fit blamed falling pupil numbers and
OL,15,Ffinancial pressures.
OL,17,FThe school's former director of music,
OL,18,FRachel Milestone, who organised the
OL,19,Fservice, said the closure had felt
OL,20,F"like a sudden bereavement".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
