OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds say farewell to closed
OL,4,Aschool at service
OL,5,
OL,6,F"All of a sudden this thing that we
OL,7,Floved is gone, and the service was a
OL,8,Fchance for us all to come together and
OL,9,Fshare in that grief," she said.
